   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ipas 2009</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ipas safe abortions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1. St&#xF6;d till Ipas; 35% Africa, 30% Asien och 35% globalt tekniskt st&#xF6;d. M&#xE5;l: &#xF6;kad tillg&#xE5;ng och &#xF6;kad kvalitet av s&#xE4;kra aborter; &#xF6;kad tillg&#xE5;ng p&#xE5; h&#xE5;llbar kunskap om teknicker f&#xF6;r aborter, &#xF6;kade  m&#xF6;jligheter f&#xF6;r kvinnor att f&#xF6;rhindra o&#xF6;nskade graviditeter inkl kunskap om var och hur detta kan f&#xE5;s; abortlagar och policies och &#xF6;kade resurser f&#xF6;r s&#xE4;kra aborter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Ipas; 35% Africa, 30% Asia and 35%global technical support 35%. Aims: to increased availability and quality of safe abortions care; increased sustainable supply of abortion technogies; women&#xB4;s availability to prevent and manage unwanted pregnacies incl knowledge of where and how to access safe abortion care; reformed abortion laws and policies and increased resources for safe abortion care.</narrative>
  </description>
